msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use this Client ID. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that registered it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify n’a pas autorisé ce compte à utiliser ce Client ID. Connectez-vous "
"avec le compte Spotify qui l’a inscrit, qui doit avoir Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:182
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Spotifast used before. Register "
"Spotifast to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify n’accepte plus la connexion partagée qu’utilisait Spotifast. "
"Inscrivez Spotifast pour continuer à écouter."

